t-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820496_25153544654312827_3606902093978631387_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6WWghvJ97KgQ7kNvwG5x-1g&_nc_oc=AdkUA9dvQZLwsE57LMuSJYKT3aTzeT5OVrI8Lr0dk-hszAaMKQVJfPeMPYKnicpVOGc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftKLJlpYjh9j9nxU6ZkQ97qHMLAlowNNyMvme7fwTRyiw&oe=699EE192"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440-screenshot (29).png", "id": "3776070896021450", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823270_3776070899354783_1245596548630707618_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mm5QoO0IsCEQ7kNvwFRigvm&_nc_oc=AdlVeIabb3pahmp4-a0rQK_rQNDzLo5FdWtj1PMMD3cf4hdasdtm686eVbRwRrGsOgk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsEowfBv5kMDtel9nhGJ4JubCPz5BXBdkp42Ld3p0HaGg&oe=699EF865"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440-screenshot (27).png", "id": "1189608243068025", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819323_1189608246401358_2671903566523338991_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PFSalKuRE98Q7kNvwHaWI1b&_nc_oc=AdkTKMmbNkI4kK3LNakwW3QgzTZvgCSMTId4IUxqUB_eUfgw-b1izhY1S-VUmxxnorQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvGonQoJGv3E_iWWS-XnDqM26XIzLNdbHDzf0dixEJE3Q&oe=699EF1D2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440 3.png", "id": "831700102786383", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823296_831700106119716_1961501613371539496_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oqnXa9wrnV8Q7kNvwF76SB5&_nc_oc=AdkO4SB2Oozo_1HbIeaBoWX3zLN2g6WNNxXAUkd7xlR3xT_3H9LHwn268LFdaaiut0g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv1uY_fC-LB2QiBYwOoVGugEi12BTgxFf7ISUqYB-8-ow&oe=699EDD8A"}, "display_name": "Zombie Fitness", "keywords": ["ZombieShooting", "HorrorShooting", "HorrorGame", "Fitness", "VRShooting"], "long_description": "Zombie Fitness \ud83d\udd2b\ud83d\udc80\nYOUR ULTIMATE INTENSE VR ZOMBIE APOCALYPSE SIMULATOR!\n\n\ud83e\udddf FACE 5 ZOMBIE TYPES from shambling Walkers to massive Boss monsters! Survive 10 STORY MISSIONS + INFINITE HORDE MODE across 5 MASSIVE MAPS:\n\u2705 Urban Decay: Blast through hyper-realistic city chaos!\n\u2705 Neon Nightmare: Light up glowing zombies in a vibrant cyberpunk wasteland!\n\u2705 Frozen Outpost: Survive the icy terror and snowy silence!\n\u2705 Abandoned Asylum: Close-quarters horror around every corner!\n\u2705 Radioactive Ruins: Mutated threats in a toxic environment!\n\n\ud83d\udd25 KEY FEATURES:\n\ud83e\udddf THRILLING RUN-&-GUN GAMEPLAY: Intense action from start to finish! Smash through hordes, dodge lethal projectile attacks, and execute perfect headshots for massive damage!\n\ud83c\udfae IMMERSIVE VR MECHANICS: Realistic physics-based weapon handling, dynamic weather effects, and a complete day/night cycle that changes the zombies' behavior and aggression!\n\ud83c\udf0d OPEN-ARENA COMBAT: Roam freely through ultra-detailed, explorable environments to find ammo, health packs, and strategic choke points!\n\ud83d\udca5 ADAPT OR DIE: Each zombie type requires a different strategy. Kite the Runners, focus-fire the Tanks, and always watch your back!\n\ud83d\udcaf ZERO PAYWALLS: All weapons, maps, and modes are 100% FREE & UNLOCKABLE through gameplay!\n\n\ud83c\udfc6 PERFECT FOR: #VRShooter fans \ud83c\udfae #MetaQuest explorers \ud83c\udf10 #ZombieGame addicts \ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f #ActionGaming\n\n\ud83d\udc49 DOWNLOAD NOW!\nOnly on the Meta Horizon Store\nSearch: \ud83d\udd0e \"Zombie Fitness\"\n\nQuest 2/3/Pro ", "short_description": "Zombie Fitness \ud83d\udd2b\ud83d\udc80\nULTIMATE VR ZOMBIE SHOOTER! Wield 5 weapons & survive 10 story missions + endless hordes across 5 massive maps! Realistic physics, dynamic weather & total exploration. 100% FREE content!\n\n#VRShooter #MetaQuest\n\nDOWNLOAD NOW!\nMeta Horizon Store"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://abdurrehmanmma12327.github.io/privacy-policy/zombiefitness/", "developer_terms_of_service